Static assets served from the site root — favicon, robots.txt, opengraph images.

Kept in git deliberately. `apps/web/Dockerfile` copies this directory into the runtime image, and
Docker fails the build outright when a COPY source does not exist. An empty directory that git
does not track is a directory that exists on the machine where the Dockerfile was written and
nowhere else, which is the class of failure that only appears in CI.
